    "notes": "The dimension change is intentionally isolated from F-011. The full-system sweep's code, test, documentation, and finding candidates are explicitly reviewed here rather than narrowed to the files that literally contain 45/43. F-019 is affected because Mini Buzdolabı dimensions are currently duplicated across catalog/state/composition, but this PR does not claim to close the broader F-019 finding. F-017 is not affected because no renderer mutation ownership changes; F-045 is not affected because historical rewrite scripts are only reference-discovered and are not modified or executed. Placement and rendering algorithms are unchanged; their inputs change from a 45x43 footprint to 50x50. Existing persisted project instances retain their stored dimensions; newly created/reconstructed Mini Buzdolabı modules use 50x50x66."
